                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0681bf79-b649-365c-b04f-ca138e26c51a",
                        "entry_id": "1ccdaa3b-b026-3b2e-8c46-ae91823deae6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "蝨蠅（Hippoboscidae），尤指羊蜱蝇（Melophagus ovinus）"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71764a4f-0ecd-4e35-834b-0b195370353a",
                                "sense_id": "0681bf79-b649-365c-b04f-ca138e26c51a",
                                "text": "Pouring with tobacco liquor is fatal to these insects, and also to the ked, Hippobosca ovina, and to the tick, Acarus reduvius, if it fairly reach them.",
                                "translation": "淋上烟草汁对于这些昆虫来说是致命的，而且如果烟草汁能直接接触到羊蜱蝇（Hippobosca ovina）和红蜱（Acarus reduvius）的话，对于它们来说也是致命的。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1da9002d-1cc1-47ce-8e1b-bf99bc0481e1",
                                "sense_id": "0681bf79-b649-365c-b04f-ca138e26c51a",
                                "text": "The common differential diagnoses include cutaneous myiasis, sheep scab and lice; however, keds are readily visible to the naked eye.[…]Adult keds are 4-6 mm long, dark red and readily visible on the neck and forelimbs.",
                                "translation": "常见的鉴别诊断包括皮肤蝇蛆病、羊疥癣和虱子；不过，羊蜱蝇很容易用肉眼看到。 […] 成年羊蜱蝇长 4-6 毫米，深红色，在颈部和前肢上很容易看到。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "578710bd-53be-4d83-b9b0-7069ba85be63",
                                "sense_id": "0681bf79-b649-365c-b04f-ca138e26c51a",
                                "text": "They watch the sheep for signs of insects or pests, such as sheep keds and sheep lice, that can irritate the sheep causing them to scratch their fleece against fences or troughs and damage or tear the wool.",
                                "translation": "他们观察羊身上是否有昆虫或害虫的迹象，例如羊蜱蝇和羊虱，这些昆虫或害虫会刺激羊，导致它们把羊毛往栅栏或水槽上蹭，从而损坏或撕裂羊毛。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
